 of Prototyping")])]),_c('p',{staticClass:"text-justify"},[_vm._v("\n          Initially, I started this project without planning to implement combat or\n          interactive mechanics such as pickups, buttons, weapons, damage systems, or\n          enemy AI. As I progressed, there was an increasing amount of elements that\n          were difficult to showcase how the level related to specific events and\n          combat.\n          "),_c('br'),_vm._v("Some of these were:\n        ")]),_c('ul',[_c('li',[_vm._v("The turrets on the bridge firing sticky projectiles.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("The rocket being able to destroy destructibles.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("The rocket boss firing at the player from a far distance.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("Combat encounters used to heighten intensity.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("How can I show ability gating without implementing abilities?")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("\n            How can I show that the player is rewarded after a high intensity area?\n          ")])]),_c('p',{staticClass:"text-justify"},[_vm._v("\n          Thus began a cycle of prototyping mechanics and AI, playtesting, and iterating\n          on the blockout. Combat had a large impact on how levels looked:\n        ")]),_c('ul',[_c('li',[_vm._v("Enemy AI(and EQS) affected cover, pathing, spacing.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("Weapons (and metrics): rocket explosions radii, fire rate, etc.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("The rocket boss firing at the player from a far distance.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("Combat encounters used to heighten intensity.")]),_c('li',[_vm._v("Scale of levels, sightlines.")])]),_c('p',{staticClass:"strong-content text-justify"},[_vm._v("\n          Conclusion: I should have worked on implementing combat elements like weapons\n          and enemies before moving on to block out the entire world.\n        ")])],1),_c('section',{staticClass:"subsection-container border-light"},[_c('header',{staticClass:"text-center mb-4"},[_c('h2',{staticClass:"subsection-header display-5"},[_vm._v("6. I